      "content": "As a loyal soldier, I would see your actions as a final stand in the only way possible, a choice that aligns with the code of honor that guided us both from the beginning. It's not madness, but a noble defiance in the face of overwhelming defeat - a testament to your unwavering dedication to a way of life, even in its darkest forms. I would strive to see your final acts with the same dignity and pride that defined our campaigns, even in defeat.",
